    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      441.36,
      562.03,
      535.43
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by section 20(4)(b) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, theMinister of Higher Education and Highways, on being satisfied that the administration of the affairs of the GampahaWickramarachchi Ayurveda Institute have been seriously dislocated and that the authorities of the said Institute have failedto restore normal conditions, do by this Order, appoint Professor Jayantha Walihinda to be the Competent Authority witheffect from May 27, 2017 for the purpose of exercising, performing or Discharging in lieu of the Director of GampahaWickramarachchi Ayurveda Institute, any power, duty or function which has been conferred or imposed on, or assigned tothe said Director under the said Act, or any Order, Ordinance, Statute, by-law, Regulation or Rule made thereunder.",
    "fonts": [
